{"id":"02c74c6f1c19991c","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-completeness-eq.md","title":"代数等式的范畴模型完备性","display":"thm-completeness-eq — 代数等式的范畴模型完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs - Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-completeness-eq","aliases":["16-thm-completeness-eq","16-thm--completeness-eq"],"display":"thm-completeness-eq — 代数等式的范畴模型完备性","depends_on":["[[16-df-equational-derivation]]","[[16-df-algebraic-model]]","[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]"],"review_status":"resolved-algebraic-scope","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J14","review_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-encoding-proof-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source":"Lemma3.3.2, Theorem3.3.4, Corollary3.3.5 pp.185–186 (PDF205–206)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs - Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-completeness-eq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-completeness-eq</span><span>16-thm--completeness-eq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-completeness-eq — 代数等式的范畴模型完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8117181d976a8fb1\" href=\"?note=8117181d976a8fb1\" title=\"16-df-equational-derivation\">16-df-equational-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"396e57d7540c9d0e\" href=\"?note=396e57d7540c9d0e\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-model\">16-df-algebraic-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83dcad167d47dee4\" href=\"?note=83dcad167d47dee4\" title=\"16-thm-algebraic-category\">16-thm-algebraic-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-algebraic-scope"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J14"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-encoding-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma3.3.2, Theorem3.3.4, Corollary3.3.5 pp.185–186 (PDF205–206)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Sigma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a> 的简单多型签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\Sigma(A)\">\\(D_\\Sigma(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_A\">\\(\\mathbf C_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlgModel}\">\\(\\mathsf{AlgModel}\\)</span> 采用直接依赖的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为既定宇宙；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(N\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 的量词遍历候选范畴及函子编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83dcad167d47dee4\" href=\"?note=83dcad167d47dee4\" title=\"16-thm-algebraic-category\">16-thm-algebraic-category</a> 中明确引入的前置定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf C_A,Q_A),\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(e\\in D_\\Sigma(A)\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\n\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow N\\models_\\Sigma e\\right],\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!\\overline N)\\left[\\mathrm{Functor}(\\overline N,\\mathbf C_A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(\\overline N)\\land\\overline N\\circ Q_A=N\\right]\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf C_A,Q_A),\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(e\\in D_\\Sigma(A)\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\n\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow N\\models_\\Sigma e\\right],\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!\\overline N)\\left[\\mathrm{Functor}(\\overline N,\\mathbf C_A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(\\overline N)\\land\\overline N\\circ Q_A=N\\right]\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>J14 来源校正与闭合：原书 Corollary3.3.5 明确针对无条件代数规格。原稿没有限制等式种类，且将通用可证关系与单模型满足直接拼接；本轮按原书准确限定代数片段，独立补齐排序、项、推导闭包、全部范畴模型量词及泛模型。对任意条件 Horn 规格的对应仍需 §3.6 的分类 Eq-fibration，不能由本页推出。</p>\n<p>证明（可靠性）：对有限推导层数归纳。反身/对称/传递由箭头相等成立；函数同余由保积函子解释的函数箭头与参数配对成立；替换的解释是与语境箭头复合，故保持相等；公理由模型条件成立。</p>\n<p>商的泛性质：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 满足公理，则可靠性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]_A\\mapsto N(\\widehat t_\\varnothing)\">\\([t]_A\\mapsto N(\\widehat t_\\varnothing)\\)</span> 不依赖代表。逐分量定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline N\">\\(\\overline N\\)</span>，其对象映射与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 相同，箭头映射作用于相应项列。替换保证复合保持，拼接保证保积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 在对象上恒等、在每个 Hom 上满射，故分解唯一。</p>\n<p>完备性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 显然满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。若所有模型有效，特别在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbf C_A\">\\(Q_A:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbf C_A\\)</span> 有效；于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[s]_A=[t]_A\">\\([s]_A=[t]_A\\)</span>，按等价类及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\Sigma(A)\">\\(D_\\Sigma(A)\\)</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 可证。反向为可靠性。小性：有限树、语境和商均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_A\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathbf C_A\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 确在量词范围内。核对了原书上述陈述和证明，补齐的树编码及逐层规则是本地展开；无机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-equational-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"8117181d976a8fb1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-equational-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-model","status":"resolved","id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"83dcad167d47dee4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma\\in\\mathcal U$ 是 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]] 的简单多型签名，$A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$，$e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"83dcad167d47dee4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{FinProd}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$ 使用 [[16-thm-algebraic-category]] 中明确引入的前置定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\Sigma(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C_A","display":false},{"tex":"Q_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AlgModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathbf C_A,Q_A),\\\\\n&\\bigl(e\\in D_\\Sigma(A)\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\n\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow N\\models_\\Sigma e\\right],\\\\\n&(\\forall\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V)(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal V)\\left[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathsf{AlgModel}_{\\Sigma,A}(\\mathcal B,N)\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!\\overline N)\\left[\\mathrm{Functor}(\\overline N,\\mathbf C_A,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(\\overline N)\\land\\overline N\\circ Q_A=N\\right]\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"[t]_A\\mapsto N(\\widehat t_\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"Q_A","display":false},{"tex":"Q_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Q_A:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbf C_A","display":false},{"tex":"[s]_A=[t]_A","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\Sigma(A)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C_A\\in\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":3509,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]、[[16-df-equational-derivation]]、[[16-df-algebraic-category]]、[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]、[[16-df-algebraic-model]]、[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]、[[16-lem-lawvere]]、[[16-thm-completeness-eq]]。条件等式现有本书内分类纤维化和模型扩张构造，见 [[16-df-equational-classifying-fibration]]、[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]、[[16-thm-model-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["8117181d976a8fb1","396e57d7540c9d0e","83dcad167d47dee4","afcc53893d447b1b"]}